- MIRANDA : Up , up , up . - TONY : Come on .

1812
01:37:38,527 --> 01:37:39,728
- Hold her head . Hold her . - Come on , Katherine .

1813
01:37:39,762 --> 01:37:41,230
- Hold her ! - TONY : I got her .

1814
01:37:41,263 --> 01:37:42,398
- I got her . - MIRANDA : Come on , come on .

1815
01:37:42,431 --> 01:37:43,699
ANN : All right . Out of the way .

1816
01:37:43,732 --> 01:37:44,667
MIRANDA : Hey . Mommy 's right here . Come on .

1817
01:37:44,700 --> 01:37:46,702
( crying )

1818
01:37:51,908 --> 01:37:54,176
TONY : Somebody help us !

1819
01:37:59,615 --> 01:38:01,851
- TONY : I did not do this . - MIRANDA : Wake up , baby .

1820
01:38:01,885 --> 01:38:03,385
Hurry , hurry .

1821
01:38:03,419 --> 01:38:04,553
MIRANDA : Wake up . Mommy 's right here . Come on .

1822
01:38:04,586 --> 01:38:06,288
STUART : We have an emergency .

1823
01:38:06,321 --> 01:38:07,556
Um , a young girl is going into cardiac arrest .

1824
01:38:07,589 --> 01:38:10,592
Send the paramedics and an ambulance now .

1825
01:38:12,261 --> 01:38:13,295
ANN : Out of the way .

1826
01:38:13,328 --> 01:38:15,631
