PARAMEDIC 2 : Can I check your pulse , please ?

1837
01:39:00,910 --> 01:39:02,678
PARAMEDIC : ... cuts to her body .

1838
01:39:02,711 --> 01:39:04,480
Go ahead and start ...

1839
01:39:04,513 --> 01:39:05,781
PARAMEDIC 2 : What I 'm gonna do is I 'm gonna check your pulse

1840
01:39:05,815 --> 01:39:07,583
and your breathing , okay ?

1841
01:39:07,616 --> 01:39:09,618
Can you do me a big favor and breathe in ?

1842
01:39:09,651 --> 01:39:11,921
PARAMEDIC : Just trying to figure out what 's going on .

1843
01:39:11,955 --> 01:39:14,356
( chatter continues indistinctly )

1844
01:39:17,593 --> 01:39:19,795
PARAMEDIC 3 : Can I check your pulse ?

1845
01:39:25,534 --> 01:39:28,704
( indistinct conversations )

1846
01:39:28,737 --> 01:39:30,874
OFFICER : Look , I 'm sorry about what 's gone on here .

1847
01:39:30,907 --> 01:39:32,541
I 'm sorry . We 're all just ...

1848
01:39:32,574 --> 01:39:34,576
OFFICER 2 : Hey , Stuart . Do you mind if I call you Stuart ?

1849
01:39:34,610 --> 01:39:36,745
OFFICER 3 : Is there anything that we can do for you

1850
01:39:36,779 --> 01:39:38,647
