1851
01:39:38,680 --> 01:39:41,885
( conversations continue indistinctly )

1852
01:39:42,785 --> 01:39:44,787
MIRANDA : Sh-She 's gone . I know she 's gone .

1853
01:39:44,821 --> 01:39:46,789
- TONY : Don 't touch her . - MIRANDA : It 's okay , Tony .

1854
01:39:46,823 --> 01:39:48,357
