1873
01:41:08,972 --> 01:41:11,473
We can heal .

1874
01:41:14,978 --> 01:41:17,914
For some of us , it 'll be harder than others .

1875
01:41:18,882 --> 01:41:20,782
For some of us ...

1876
01:41:20,817 --> 01:41:22,151
